<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed slightly higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 4.41 to 8198.45.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 0.95 to 491.93.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.08.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 1484 to 1365.</p>
<p>Volume was 455,995,140 compared with 511,634,810 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
